---
// About section — bio, facts list and placeholder selfie.
---

<section id="about" class="section section--about">
  <div class="section__header">
    <h2 class="section__title">About me</h2>
    <span class="section__aside">[ about / 01 ]</span>
  </div>

  <div class="about__grid">
    <div class="about__bio">
      <p>
        I'm <strong>Daril J. Burgos</strong>, a junior web developer who recently
        graduated from
        <em> Caraga State University - Main Campus</em>. I like boring code that works and
        interfaces that don't get in the way.
      </p>
      <p>
        When I'm not coding, I'm reading about accessibility, breaking my own
        side projects, or learning the next framework everyone is talking about.
      </p>
      <dl class="about__facts">
        <div>
          <dt>Based in</dt>
          <dd>Butuan City, Philippines</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Stack</dt>
          <dd>HTML · CSS · JS · React</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Experience</dt>
          <dd>Entry level / hungry</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Status</dt>
          <dd class="status">
            <span class="status__dot"></span> Open to work
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <div class="about__photo" data-reveal>
      <div class="photo photo--bounce">
        YOUR
        <br />
        PHOTO
        <br />
        HERE
      </div>
      <p class="photo__caption">[ that's me, presumably ]</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
